{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a high-stakes game of <i>social deduction</i> for 4-10 players where your allegiances are tested and your friendships are put on the line. In fast-paced matches of subterfuge, a team of <strong>Heroes</strong> must work together to complete their objectives while hidden <strong>Villains</strong> embedded among them attempt to counter their every move. To survive, you'll need to read your opponents, bluff your way out of suspicion, and decide who you can really trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- VILLAINS -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deceive and trick the <strong>HEROS</strong> in order to sow chaos. Grab nearby <strong>weapons</strong> to obliterate everyone, until only <i>VILLAINY</i> remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/extras/da7f810cb4105b0c2003cee7501debb4.poster.avif?t=1759011377\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/extras/da7f810cb4105b0c2003cee7501debb4.webm?t=1759011377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/extras/da7f810cb4105b0c2003cee7501debb4.mp4?t=1759011377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- HEROS -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to survive. Complete <strong>objectives</strong> and withstand <strong>curses</strong> until you discover the <i>villain</i> among you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/extras/da7d852f3f0182f7f51995eefd7716da.poster.avif?t=1759011377\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/extras/da7d852f3f0182f7f51995eefd7716da.webm?t=1759011377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/extras/da7d852f3f0182f7f51995eefd7716da.mp4?t=1759011377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- EVERYONE -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has a wide range of <strong>abilities</strong> that can turn the tide of any situation. <strong>Any</strong> character can be the <i>hero</i>, or the <i>villain</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/extras/0ac88b5e1f43b22160b28d09f3ab00f7.poster.avif?t=1759011377\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/extras/0ac88b5e1f43b22160b28d09f3ab00f7.webm?t=1759011377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/extras/0ac88b5e1f43b22160b28d09f3ab00f7.mp4?t=1759011377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017450?t=1759011377","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017450?t=1759011377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/9584fe809e19703d6c09187f8ea56fe2461c7019/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759011377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017450/9584fe809e19703d6c09187f8ea56fe2461c7019/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759011377","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id"